    rdf:value """Wednesday, August 23, 1916, Marina di Massa
Fine
Bathed.
Geoffrey and Iris and I went to the amphitheatre at Luni, a perfectly unspoilt and most enchanting place, - “stimmungsvoll” as those loathsome Germans would say.
We looked at possible sites for Villas. """^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 200 ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:part_of <https://mbdiaries.itatti.harvard.edu/resource/diary/1916> .

